@Eam.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Liveness probe
GET {{Eam.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{Eam.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Unknown route returns ProblemDetails (404)
GET {{Eam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### CORS preflight from the development frontend origin
OPTIONS {{Eam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/assets
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
